<title>HUNGARY: Budapest BSE suspends Skala for rest of day.</title>
<headline>Budapest BSE suspends Skala for rest of day.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange suspended trading in holding company Skala-Coop shares for the rest of the day after a too rapid intraday rise, traders told Reuters.</p>
<p>Skala shares opened at 2,100 forints, above Tuesday's close of 2,020 forints and surged more than 20 percent to 2,440 forints, triggering its suspension.</p>
<p>The last deal was concluded at 1132 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
